*Heading
Two cantilevers: a pipe section on PIPE31 elements and a box section on B32 elements
** Both L = 100, E = 1e5, clamped at x = 0.  Euler-Bernoulli tip deflection P L^3 / (3 E I):
** - PIPE, outer radius 1, wall 0.2: I = pi (1 - 0.8^4) / 4 = 0.4637; P = 1 in -y -> 7.189.
** - BOX, a = 2 along local 1 (-z), b = 3 along local 2 (+y), walls t1 = t3 = 0.1 (at +-1)
**   and t2 = t4 = 0.2 (at +-2): I11 = 1.8636, I22 = 0.7364; P = 1 in -y -> 1.789, in -z -> 4.527.
** ccx 2.23 runs PIPE and BOX sections only on B32R, so abq2ccx emits the PIPE31 beams as
** B32R with a midside node per element and the B32 beams as B32R; both data lines pass
** through unchanged (the two codes read them alike).
